.SH NDJSON wire format (\f[CR]WIRE_NDJSON\f[R])
If the payload starts with \f[CR]{\f[R] (JSON object), the channel is
injected as \f[CR]\(dqch\(dq:N\f[R] at the start of the object and a
newline is appended.
Uses \f[CR]writev(2)\f[R] for zero\-copy assembly of the output.
.PP
If the payload does not start with \f[CR]{\f[R], it is wrapped as:
\f[CR]{\(dqch\(dq:N,\(dqdata\(dq:\(dq...\(dq}\(rsn\f[R].
.PP
The \f[CR]flags\f[R] parameter is ignored in NDJSON mode.
